GPL-2.0-or-later Components

The files src/ezusb.c and include/ezusb.h are derived from the Linux
kernel fxload utility and are licensed under the GNU General Public
License v2 or later. See the license headers in those files for details.

Because rx888_stream links with ezusb.c, the rx888_stream binary as a
whole is distributed under the terms of the GPL-2.0-or-later.

The remaining programs (rx888_dsp, iqrecord) do not link GPL code and
are covered solely by the MIT license above.
